{"hw":"μαντικός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μαντικός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μαντικός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">prophetic, oracular</b>, <span class=\"gk\">κλέος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1098</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. μυχοί, θρόνοι</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">180</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">616</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τέχνη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">350.6</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. φῆμαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">oracular</b> sayings, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">723</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ μ. γένος,</span> = μάντεις, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1055</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ μ. σπέρμα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">520</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. ἐπίπνοια</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">prophetic</b> inspiration, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">265b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">λόγοι μ.</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">275b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. ζῷα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Porph.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Abst.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.48</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">τέχνη μ.</span> faculty <b class=\"lex-tr\">of divination, prophecy</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">709</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1274a28</span> </span>, etc.; more freq. <span class=\"gk\">ἡ μαντική</span> alone, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.49</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.68</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ.. μ. ἡ τοῦ δαιμονίου</span>, of Socrates, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">40a</span> </span>: in Poets without Art., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">484</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">311</span> </span>; also in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">μαντικὴν Ἀπόλλων ἀνηῦρεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">197a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. ἔνθεος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">244b</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.103</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> of persons, <b class=\"lex-tr\">like a prophet, oracular</b>, <span class=\"gk\">μ. γὰρ εἶ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.115a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">85b</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hes.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> - <span class=\"gk\">κῶς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pax</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1026</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">198a</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}